{"event_type":"review","id":"f88bc252895fc238d2115aaf875b17f12d6121b703f6131db4a4b7987d8b4d45","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T23:32:30Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/420f1537ba9cebf3492d58b82b78da2a96a57e9e79d14eb494427b872426b947","sha256":"420f1537ba9cebf3492d58b82b78da2a96a57e9e79d14eb494427b872426b947"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/70083916546c13e0d84f914e97239f522ab7c419f400b91e0379c4dd05f29856","sha256":"70083916546c13e0d84f914e97239f522ab7c419f400b91e0379c4dd05f29856"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/44f6939caf4d166616f9a44e5a7db48169d788beccc996971a5f45d00148b27a","sha256":"44f6939caf4d166616f9a44e5a7db48169d788beccc996971a5f45d00148b27a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/6445f46054cc31f2147a11b9efa3505e676f6c6972a5365a4c68d0532a443b7a","sha256":"6445f46054cc31f2147a11b9efa3505e676f6c6972a5365a4c68d0532a443b7a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1294374081b43ba84f08377698e4afe6100d40a2fb48414fe28681c5648ed2be","sha256":"1294374081b43ba84f08377698e4afe6100d40a2fb48414fe28681c5648ed2be"}],"attempt_id":"dbebc5cd5bb59067356a491b5fdbdd92dc21946ff5c0c08e814c9c2e31eee990:0:1","base":"1741acf88d4817d24428a62e63ebd7f3386f4034","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","body":"**A reinstall failure discards all probe attribution.**\n\n`src/ops/dev/cycle.ts:971` wraps the initial install and returns a scoped attribution. The reinstall at `src/ops/dev/cycle.ts:1060` is not wrapped. If it rejects, for example on the `AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs)` abort, the rejection passes through `scanNewestFirst`. It then reaches the catch at `src/ops/dev/cycle.ts:881`. The result is the generic \"the probe phase threw\" attribution. The `scan.probes` already gathered and the candidate that faulted are lost from the surfaced result.\n\nReturn a `fault` probe instead. `scanNewestFirst` already stops on `fault` and reports the probe list through `probeLines`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-                await installDeps(tmp, AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs));\n-                installedAt = commit;\n+                try {\n+                  await installDeps(tmp, AbortSignal.timeout(reinstallMs));\n+                } catch (err) {\n+                  return {\n+                    commit,\n+                    verdict: 'fault',\n+                    detail: `dependency reinstall failed: ${(err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err)).slice(0, 300)}`,\n+                  };\n+                }\n+                installedAt = commit;\n```\n</details>","id":"1d9e510d9769eb115d53bdbb631ebd8febef8e30f5e961cd26185df56703b2d8","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"A reinstall failure discards all probe attribution."}],"head":"7afc601a1574ee6ed26985aefd6954359af12bc8","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"eaa2a3c5878576374d948aa23606d149ead54825","intervals":[[1,83]],"path":"src/ops/dev/agentReview.ts"},{"blob":"6b74312969034d2a30f51c9b75aa6d5bc000a2e0","intervals":[[1,1495]],"path":"src/ops/dev/cycle.ts"},{"blob":"95ac5a9901a5143fcc019c23744b1975d846ae9b","intervals":[[1,589]],"path":"src/ops/dev/denylist.ts"},{"blob":"50de3cb152a9f7ab1c129cbf3a12a3813d345c0f","intervals":[[1,392]],"path":"src/ops/dev/registry.ts"},{"blob":"8c3dd8de30919f02f60da79cc421eac1d241e120","intervals":[[1,212]],"path":"src/ops/dev/review-transport.ts"}],"job_id":"dbebc5cd5bb59067356a491b5fdbdd92dc21946ff5c0c08e814c9c2e31eee990:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"eaa2a3c5878576374d948aa23606d1